title: "Add `slash_submission_deposit` extrinsic to pallet-referenda"
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |
    Adds a new extrinsic `slash_submission_deposit` to `pallet-referenda` that allows slashing
    the submission deposit for referenda that have been `Rejected` or `TimedOut`.

    This complements the existing `refund_submission_deposit` which only works for `Approved`
    or `Cancelled` referenda.

crates:
- name: pallet-referenda
  bump: major
- name: rococo-runtime
  bump: major
- name: asset-hub-westend-runtime
  bump: major
- name: collectives-westend-runtime
  bump: major